#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:1
#: 1553b49f209f40e8952fe8f0b9bc7e3b
msgid "Driver layer parameters"
msgstr "驱动层参数"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:3
#: c64b3746a534406791baa72fc9dbb485
msgid ""
"ros2_control **driver layer** (驱动层) plugin arguments. These are URDF / "
"xacro `<param>` entries under `<ros2_control><hardware>`, loaded in the "
"plugin `on_init`. They are **not** the same API as `ros2 param list` on a"
" controller node, unless that plugin also `declare_parameter`s them (ARX,"
" HighTorque, Marvin, some 灵巧手)."
msgstr ""
"ros2_control **驱动层**插件参数。它们是 `<ros2_control><hardware>` 下的 URDF / xacro `<param>`，在插件 "
"`on_init` 加载。与控制器节点上的 `ros2 param list` **不是**同一套 API，除非该插件也把它们 `declare_parameter` "
"了（ARX、HighTorque、Marvin、部分灵巧手）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: ea167a9cdc844cc5a027f54bd39432b2
msgid ""
"How `hardware:=` selects a plugin: [ros2_control in This "
"Stack](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md). How to inspect: "
"[Configure ROS 2 controller "
"parameters](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md). Package "
"list: [Public driver layer](1-public_hi.md)."
msgstr ""
"`hardware:=` 如何选插件：[本栈中的 ros2_control](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md)。如何查看：[配置 "
"ROS 2 控制器参数](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md)。软件包列表：[公开驱动层](1-public_hi.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:7
#: a7eb4c7c41d248ac954dadef210af466
msgid ""
"The in-tree [`hardwares/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115/hardwares/README.md)"
" is **build-only** (`colcon build --packages-up-to …`). Names below come "
"from each public README and from `on_init` / plugin XML in that "
"repository."
msgstr ""
"树内 [`hardwares/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115/hardwares/README.md) "
"只讲**编译**（`colcon build --packages-up-to …`）。下面的名称来自各公开 README，以及该仓库的 `on_init` "
"/ 插件 XML。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:9
#: c45a6f2b4b7a4d32b856d1aa72fe1f4a
msgid "How to read the tables"
msgstr "如何读这些表"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:11
#: 20c97f87e7a3422ea4aa0dd6e4830ee9
msgid ""
"Three columns: **Parameter**, **Type / default**, **Meaning** (the "
"**When** tag is the last sentence of Meaning)."
msgstr "三列：**参数**、**类型 / 默认值**、**含义**（**何时生效**写在含义的最后一句）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md
#: f9ae44194ac64828b15748e6366e239a
msgid "Tag"
msgstr "标记"

