msgstr "依据"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md
#: b558f2e61d0444e4861cf4503178943b
msgid "**Startup only**"
msgstr "**仅启动**"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md
#: dc09ed6f7fa34947bd0e83676a631c9c
msgid ""
"Read in `on_init` from `info_.hardware_parameters`. No "
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback` (or README does not claim a hot update)."
" Change the xacro and restart the hardware / `controller_manager`."
msgstr ""
"在 `on_init` 从 `info_.hardware_parameters` 读取。没有 `add_on_set_parameters_callback`（或 "
"README 未声明可热更新）。改 xacro 并重启硬件 / `controller_manager`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md
#: a9800203272946d0bffc3d2931954dec
msgid "**Runtime**"
msgstr "**运行时**"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md
#: f709f396d7384748b5fad2c7c81adb3b
msgid ""
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback`, or a README + source path that re-reads"
" `ros2 param set` without reload (HighTorque kp/kd poll)."
msgstr ""
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback`，或 README + 源码路径表明 `ros2 param set` 无需重载即可生效（HighTorque "
"的 kp/kd 轮询）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:18
#: 812e79eebd6d4614981fb36138ce1eac
msgid ""
"Simulation `mock_components` / `gz` / `isaac` keys: [Driver "
"layer](0-index.md). Private packages: [Private driver "
"layer](2-private_hi.md)."
msgstr ""
"仿真键 `mock_components` / `gz` / `isaac`：[驱动层](0-index.md)。私有软件包：[私有驱动层](2-private_hi.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:20
#: ee48ba44747b4755bfcf242b6b7bc394
msgid "topic_based_ros2_control"
msgstr "topic_based_ros2_control"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:22
#: 501d956468e64a4dbcec5374ee7aaa82
msgid ""
"In-tree under `arms_ros2_control/hardwares/` (not a nested gitmodule). "
"Used when `hardware:=isaac` (Acone xacro: `/isaac/joint_command`, "
"`/isaac/joint_states`). README: "
"[topic_based_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/README.md)."
" Source: [`topic_based_system.cpp`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/src/topic_based_system.cpp)"
" at [`d50933d`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115)."
msgstr ""
"位于 `arms_ros2_control/hardwares/` 树内（不是嵌套 gitmodule）。用于 `hardware:=isaac`（Acone "
"xacro：`/isaac/joint_command`、`/isaac/joint_states`）。README：[topic_based_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/README.md)。源码：[`d50933d`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115) "
"的 [`topic_based_system.cpp`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/src/topic_based_system.cpp)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:24
#: 71564e61d26443a890d3e9979586d911
msgid ""
"Plugin: `topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem`. No "
"`declare_parameter` and no `on_set_parameters`."
msgstr ""
"插件：`topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem`。没有 `declare_parameter`，也没有 `on_set_parameters`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:26
#: 7b622c93670e489d8ef46cf3c2a71130
msgid ""
"<ros2_control name=\"my_system\" type=\"system\">\n"
"  <hardware>\n"
"    <plugin>topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem</plugin>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_commands_topic\">/robot_joint_commands</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_states_topic\">/robot_joint_states</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"initialize_commands_from_state\">true</param>\n"
"  </hardware>\n"
"</ros2_control>"
msgstr ""
"<ros2_control name=\"my_system\" type=\"system\">\n"
"  <hardware>\n"
"    <plugin>topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem</plugin>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_commands_topic\">/robot_joint_commands</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_states_topic\">/robot_joint_states</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"initialize_commands_from_state\">true</param>\n"
"  </hardware>\n"
"</ros2_control>"

